{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Hero Hellspawn - Roguelite English Learning Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep challenging yourself and <strong>\u2694\ufe0f strengthen your hero!</strong><br>Open treasure chests to <strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f strategically optimize your build</strong>,<br>and <strong>\ud83e\udde0 solve English quizzes to defeat powerful monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>\ud83d\udcd6 English Learning Points</strong> \ud83d\udd39<br>\u2705 <strong>\ud83d\udccc Sentence-based learning</strong> is more effective for vocabulary acquisition.<br>\u2705 <strong>\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Actively using (outputting) the language</strong> enhances learning efficiency.<br>\u2705 <strong>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f A language not used will eventually be forgotten.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>\ud83d\udeeb Learn essential travel phrases, \ud83c\udfe1 daily expressions, and \ud83c\udff7\ufe0f object descriptions!</strong><br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>\ud83d\udcda Master words &amp; phrases from popular games and play without unknown words!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>If creating an English-speaking environment is difficult, enjoy your favorite \ud83c\udfae games, \ud83c\udfac movies, and \ud83d\udcfa TV series in English!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcda <strong>\ud83d\udd0d List of useful words &amp; phrases in popular games</strong><br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>DAVE THE DIVER</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514030?t=1742734608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514030?t=1742734608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514030/40ee12d5e4cb8c1f1a35c99cee4b04e2a17b51fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742734608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store